OL,3,ARoyal Navy sailor charged with spying
OL,4,Afor a foreign power
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Royal Navy sailor has been charged
OL,7,Fwith spying for an unnamed foreign
OL,8,Fcountry, police have said.
OL,10,FAble Seaman Teddy Young, 24, from
OL,11,FBedfordshire, has been charged with
OL,12,Foffences under the National Security
OL,13,FAct (NSA) including an allegation of
OL,14,Fobtaining protected information which
OL,15,Fcould benefit an unnamed foreign power.
OL,17,FHe has been remanded into custody and
OL,18,Fis due to appear at Westminster
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
