OL,3,AMost UK diplomats to leave East
OL,4,AJerusalem consulate, Israel says, as
OL,5,AMiliband says 'vital services' to
OL,6,Aremain
OL,7,
OL,8,FMost diplomats will leave the British
OL,9,Fconsulate in occupied East Jerusalem,
OL,10,FIsrael says, but the UK insists the
OL,11,Fbuilding "will not be closing", and
OL,12,Fwill operate as a "UK Mission".
OL,14,F"We did not want it to come to this,"
OL,15,FIsraeli Foreign Minister Gideon Saar
OL,16,Fwrote on social media, as he said 20
OL,17,Fdiplomats and the consul general would
OL,18,Fleave Israel while a task force of
OL,19,Fseven could remain in the building
OL,20,F"with a very limited scope of
OL,21,Factivity".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
