OL,3,ASpanish pensioner whose eviction
OL,4,Asparked nationwide protests dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly woman whose eviction sparked
OL,7,Fnationwide protests over Spain's
OL,8,Fhousing crisis and a political row that
OL,9,Ftriggered early elections has died,
OL,10,Faccording to Madrid's tenants union.
OL,12,FMaricarmen Abascal, 87, was forcibly
OL,13,Fremoved on a stretcher from her
OL,14,Fapartment of more than 70 years on 23
OL,15,FSeptember after she was unable to
OL,16,Fafford steep rent increases.
OL,18,FThe company that owned the flat later
OL,19,Foffered to allow her to return at a
OL,20,Flower rate - but she was unable to sign
OL,21,Fan agreement as she had been admitted
OL,22,Fto hospital.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
