OL,3,ASpanish pensioner whose eviction
OL,4,Asparked nationwide protests dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnouncing her death, Madrid Tenants'
OL,7,FUnion said Abascal's situation marked
OL,8,F"a turning point in the history of this
OL,9,Fcountry".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
